。更好的增长前景反映出对全球能源危机和贸易紧张局势的意外恢复力，可能会释放数十亿欧元，总理可能会用这些资金为承诺的减税提供资金，同时仍然尊重欧盟规则。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;上月初在卡塔尔装载的&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;一艘液化天然气油轮&lt;/strong&gt;已驶过霍尔木兹海峡，这是自7月以来该国液化天然气首次通过该水路&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/8AfiXFw2HzdsDRzGnFzX4A3hvEoFmksPKaZyI52X8UaRcZwR_psxnFcmtKc1lv8oJdL-of4MwQtc9-AblY0BEh0bywpiBYP3z7gGAw07oey-hTv1auVZrtB8RNC_hpsxVP5Yl20B5nRdIbChmqHE_0JT9v7mGlAbgY15rIqE5UcXVW1g6uRPc7J0I9ZNdC9WjCq7Jd_XtTNmMDkuhyEtysfd_h9OqUHkdABrH5A1Jt4FyJ0JUb-K9vWNdllH6_tschltJDv7dgTONJHtXmodJi0mu5R5dcDJsBzpyw6tkCCyEoOadIJ3iC1J1Hp0NpX0R2rtu_Woa8I6Ge6oyu1EMisEYpsvl9SsSb88z4kieLLG9h4WgLwjnCY-TMMckgtdMINWlDchzDTdBTCT_hyGxgRuFXZi2N9rhw7wRz8zD73-pRW0UM8MeWQPiVV7NxsLmpXTEI3LKJl44rsYaj67s4Dq-bZ_SQwJPzsT4fy-a8QkosUt8mu1dgiVMbVCAynxtCgEnRQ8KUgLi4TThI74ZJeCZDIrKyh-ztCx0nT3QAKC1A/fE0Cmvuz3ooa_DPEAVv3NzH6r1pH-Gvr/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="卡塔尔几周内通过霍尔木兹出口第一批液化天然气"&gt;明显出口&lt;/a&gt;。伊朗表示， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/bj3tpyq1nOfDiDQX-f4pMqcSps7cFlE-h4dpyrAPw7P7fGcHJvbJurn_i5vuNGRaFjGUWoQCLePO7hwiN_pRc4IbegkmQJRf-czk_n2mKqjo8nNGkJzMVksG1w2SGca6tn15g-BWgtXz6dFm6DTjZLvh49hzEeNiytbgHo-Eas6mUeI-S5sMW15pcgoMDDzcUYgU7vCkd9ZoJrbKtBgqUAU_Gw8ZqjD0z17k0uWKG-9I20Vsqy5EEF0EtLgoBZLWV9gU_pmRv4OUOgtpEV_2679GHndqqL_MAj5X7IaW3F9zqBiILWy9FggtC3gmEut1UQRkC2keDQtMhu0V4p4hY1eRfHfGLlMqZEDdzekUMVgFxBqzMYemH_2Rny_CW9emhGMA2GHlnxvPJBtlfW1sd2gr8H48XXUPP2mEbDJ2OISYfImp57xVeOaOLEHAdvrqGP1hq_hzNJ_Iy6KcWBgKaPImfLvI0hUyqYi-fgZTVM5YEBgkH9m4k7mbpaeKSCKRKwcZE0y5JLjICSmkVQMVCQ/yGgUepH1kqX2KZs3KSlUUwI5rl7EFWa2/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="沙特能源基地遭受袭击导致布伦特原油价格飙升近 100 美元"&gt;即将&lt;/a&gt;与阿曼达成协议，管理该海峡的航运，交易员仍在权衡此举，因为这可能会加强德黑兰的控制，并引发人们对美国将如何应对的疑问。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/XM_OBpAMy7wNENfiMgnwd4wQsjgx2IKqS47CmGpJ-lPrq7A58z